---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Lichen" description="An overview of the science and spirituality that inform our approach to holistic healthcare.">
  <section class="container container--narrow page">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1 class="display h-1">A network where ancient wisdom meets modern medicine</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Lichen is a nonprofit holistic healing network. We connect people to the land, plants, animals, elements, healers and modern medical technology necessary to awaken their innate capacity to heal — individually, in community, and in reciprocity with the living world.</p>
      <p>Our approach is grounded in a simple, radical idea: the human mind, body and spirit are an integrated system that cannot be separated from the community, environment and universe from which it emerges. Healing the world starts with healing ourselves.</p>
      <h2>Where to go next</h2>
      <p><a href="/ourstory">Our Story</a> — how Lichen began. <a href="/vision">Our Vision</a> — the world we're working toward. <a href="/care-model">Our Model of Care</a> — how it works in practice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.page{padding-block:var(--s-9);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-5)}</style>
